cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CELERIS in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "CELERIS: a from-scratch RCWA metalens/metasurface design and analysis pipeline"
abstract: >-
  CELERIS is an end-to-end metalens/metasurface design tool built on a from-scratch,
  validated rigorous coupled-wave analysis (RCWA) electromagnetic solver. It spans the
  full workflow — meta-atom library sweeps, phase mapping, achromatic and
  Pancharatnam–Berry design, a full optical analysis battery (Strehl/FWHM, PSF, MTF,
  wavefront/Zernike, through-focus, chromatic, field, tolerance), and fabrication-ready
  GDSII export — and reproduces canonical published metalens devices end to end.
type: software
authors:
